  "explanation": {
    "en": "BOS continues the trend; CHoCH is the first sign the sequence of higher lows has broken. It is a warning, not a reversal guarantee.",
    "bn": "BOS trend চালু রাখে; CHoCH হলো higher low-র ধারা ভাঙার প্রথম সংকেত। এটি সতর্কতা, reversal-এর নিশ্চয়তা নয়।"
  },
  "keyTakeaways": [
    {
      "en": "Close beyond the swing = structure break",
      "bn": "Swing-এর বাইরে close = structure break"
    }
  ],
